	<content contentuid="he3155afeg1812g4c09gab0dg8bcf73812e9b" version="1">Soft Landing</content>
	<content contentuid="h04876635g1a46g4a31g977fg9cf73b42a24f" version="1">The wearer gains &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FEATHER_FALL"&gt;Feather Fall&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="ha9913f12g24d6g48ddgb23cg9ae25a93dd39" version="1">Lolth's Whisper</content>
	<content contentuid="h0d562feagb477g4e06gb7c9ga43b4e0428c3" version="1">Lolth's Vengeance</content>
	<content contentuid="h4463f4d9g69ccg4522g9bfcg01a548a1d969" version="1">Weapon attacks deal an &lt;b&gt;extra&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ENSNARED"&gt;Ensnared&lt;/LSTag&gt; targets.</content>
	<content contentuid="hc0cb8c7agbbc8g4f81g832aga6b8a64fa68a" version="1">You gain &lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt; to your &lt;LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed"&gt;Movement Speed&lt;/LSTag&gt;, and moving away does not provoke &lt;LSTag Tooltip="OpportunityAttack"&gt;Opportunity Attacks&lt;/LSTag&gt; when you have &lt;b&gt;[1]%&lt;/b&gt; or less &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;HP&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="h673bd5f3g5c00g4b84g9fe1gdc53b3d1d28b" version="1">You gain &lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt; to your &lt;LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed"&gt;Movement Speed&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;Resistance&lt;/LSTag&gt; to all physical damage, and moving away does not provoke &lt;LSTag Tooltip="OpportunityAttack"&gt;Opportunity Attacks&lt;/LSTag&gt; when you have &lt;b&gt;[1]%&lt;/b&gt; or less &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;HP&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="he1164463g9f65g4e9cg9ea4g7750fba75005" version="1">When you damage a creature with this weapon, regain &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;. The blade deals an &lt;b&gt;extra&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
